   [src/alias.rs:17](/work/crate/src/alias.rs:17), [src/invocation_parser.rs:333](/work/crate/src/invocation_parser.rs:333)


P0117    `cargo clippy --locked --all --all-targets --all-features -- --deny warnings` fails on `clippy::manual_assert_eq`.


P0118    Allowing that lint exposes `clippy::assert_is_empty` failures at `src/invocation_parser.rs:333`, `:404`, `:648`, and supporting test `tests/choose.rs:243`. Allowing both lints makes the full check pass.


